they are:Excalibur,Stormbringer,Snickersnee,Cleaver,Grimtooth,Orchist,Sting
Frost Brand,Fire Brand,Sunsword,Dragonbane,Demonbane,Werebane,Giantslayer,
Orgesmasher,Mjollnir,Trollsbane.
So far I only had, given to me, Stormbringer,Cleaver,Grimtooth,Orchist,
and Frost Brand. The first 4 was from a Valkyrie character,chaotic.
Stormbringer seems to be the most powerful, 4 or 5 hits to kill the Medusa.
It "draws out life" from the monster you hit. Grimtooth, a dagger, almost
always hit the target you throw at.

You might know that Excallibur is a long sword but you just can't name any
long sword Excalibur, if you try by #name you hand will slip and you mispelled
the name.
Named weapons are given by the god of your alignment at their alter. I found
Orchist in one game and Cleaver in a shop in another,but it was cursed.
To get the god to give you a named weapon you have to make one or more
offerings at the alter. Be warned that human offering is dangerous(!) if you
are chaotic, and (I think) angers your god greatly if you are of some other
alienment. Gods like fresh offerings and edible ones at that,eg not kobolds.
Its not *really* that hard. I *know* it is fustrating sometimes when I get
killed so quickly! Well, once you get 'em weapons its your turn to kick some
butts!

